doc ///
  Key
    cos
    (cos,InexactNumber)
  Headline
    compute the cosine
  Usage
    cos x
    cos I
  Inputs
    x:RR
    I:RRi
  Outputs
    :RR
      the cosine of @TT "x"@
    :RRi
      an interval containing the cosines of points of @TT "I"@
  Description
    Example
      cos 2
